{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "037a9d5e-33f7-837c-a0f6-ff33fb97b78b",
  "created_at": "2026-03-09T12:32:57-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Margaret Lawton",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:29:43-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:29:46-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. Good afternoon. Um, I am calling because I want to buy a shed. A small one, for the yard. And I do not know what I need, the, um, the paper from the city."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:29:57-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So a shed, you'd likely be looking at a permit depending on the size. Is it a prefab one, or are you building it yourself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:30:06-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Prefab. Yes, prefab. It comes already, um, in pieces, and they bring it. Ten feet by eight feet, I think. Or maybe eight by ten. Is that the same?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:30:15-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same footprint, yeah. Eighty square feet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:30:18-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So my question is the, the setback. How far from the line of the lot must it be? The neighbor line, I mean. I do not want to put it and then they tell me move it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:30:30-04:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that's the smart thing to ask before you buy. There's a minimum distance from the side and rear lot lines, and it depends on your zoning district. I can't tell you the number without knowing which district you're in. Do you have your plot plan, or a survey of the property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:30:46-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A survey... I think I have, in a folder. Is that the paper with the drawing of the house and the lines? With the, um, the little numbers?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:30:55-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the one. Measurements along each side of the lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:30:59-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, okay. I have it. But the distance, it is from the wall of the shed, or from the, the roof that sticks out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:31:07-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Usually it's measured from the nearest part of the structure, so the overhang can count. When you come in or send the application, we'll check it against the plan. Bring that survey and mark where you want the shed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:31:20-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mark with a pen, on the survey. Okay. [pause] And how long, um, how many days until you say yes or no? Because the company wants to deliver, and I do not know if I wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:31:31-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Don't schedule delivery yet. For a simple shed it's usually not long, often a week or two, but it depends how busy we are and whether the application is complete. Wait for the approval first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:31:42-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A week or two. Okay. I understand. Sorry, my English, sometimes the words they go away. In my head I know, but in the mouth, no."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:31:50-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're doing fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:31:52-04:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. It is for the garden things, you know. Tools, the, um, the bicycles. And I think about the place where I put it, and I remember, when I was little, we went on the school trip to Fort Adams. All the grass there, so big. Now I just want a little place for my tools. [pause] Sorry, that is not important."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:32:11-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's fine. So here's what to do. Pull the survey, get the shed's exact dimensions from the seller, and come by the office or look on the city website for the shed permit form. Fill that out and attach the marked-up survey."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:32:24-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The form is called, um, shed permit? Or is another name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:32:28-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Look for the accessory structure or shed application. If you can't tell which, call back or ask at the counter and we'll point you to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:32:36-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Accessory structure. Okay. So, the shed is the accessory, not the house. Yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:32:41-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly, the house is the main structure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:32:44-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I think I understand. A little. I will find the paper and call again if I am lost. Thank you, Mr. Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:32:52-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:32:55-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
